      "messages": {
        "202090000": {
          "id": 202090000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "小灰鱼儿，你们要出发了吗？我为你们准备了一些饯别的蜜酿。因为是特调，也想来问问你的意见。",
          "next": [
            202090001
          ]
        },
        "202090001": {
          "id": 202090001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090002,
            202090003,
            202090004
          ]
        },
        "202090002": {
          "id": 202090002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "感谢，有心了！",
          "next": [
            202090007
          ]
        },
        "202090003": {
          "id": 202090003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我大喝特喝！",
          "next": [
            202090007
          ]
        },
        "202090004": {
          "id": 202090004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我可以喝吗？",
          "next": [
            202090005
          ]
        },
        "202090005": {
          "id": 202090005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "按照以往的经验，我降低了一些浓度，以适合人类的口味。",
          "next": [
            202090006
          ]
        },
        "202090006": {
          "id": 202090006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090007
          ]
        },
        "202090007": {
          "id": 202090007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "这一瓶以裂谷的蜜汁作基底，搭配鲜榨的月亮果，口感酸甜，粉色小水母应该会喜欢的。",
          "next": [
            202090008
          ]
        },
        "202090008": {
          "id": 202090008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090009
          ]
        },
        "202090009": {
          "id": 202090009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "青色的龙鱼总令我想起深海遗冰——再加入薄荷与生姜风味的蜜酿，也许能够有助于他的思考。",
          "next": [
            202090010
          ]
        },
        "202090010": {
          "id": 202090010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090011
          ]
        },
        "202090011": {
          "id": 202090011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "还有几瓶虽然没有标注赠送者，但你一定知道它们更适合谁。",
          "next": [
            202090012
          ]
        },
        "202090012": {
          "id": 202090012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090013
          ]
        },
        "202090013": {
          "id": 202090013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "有一瓶入喉即如炽日般温暖，却是用仅夜中出没的红冠海参所做，品完更会让人不舍入睡。",
          "next": [
            202090014
          ]
        },
        "202090014": {
          "id": 202090014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090015
          ]
        },
        "202090015": {
          "id": 202090015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "棕色的蜜酿混合了海底山的营养矿物，它能放很久，依旧不变原初之味。",
          "next": [
            202090016
          ]
        },
        "202090016": {
          "id": 202090016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090017
          ]
        },
        "202090017": {
          "id": 202090017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "最后一瓶加入了一群银鱼彼此携鳍摆尾搅出的汁水，清凉谐和，回甘尤其惊喜。",
          "next": [
            202090018
          ]
        },
        "202090018": {
          "id": 202090018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090019,
            202090020
          ]
        },
        "202090019": {
          "id": 202090019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "那我的呢？",
          "next": [
            202090023
          ]
        },
        "202090020": {
          "id": 202090020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "这些奇奇怪怪的配方，你跟我们姬子姐一定会很有话聊",
          "next": [
            202090021
          ]
        },
        "202090021": {
          "id": 202090021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "那样便好，希望她会喜欢。",
          "next": [
            202090022
          ]
        },
        "202090022": {
          "id": 202090022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090023
          ]
        },
        "202090023": {
          "id": 202090023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "小灰鱼儿，这最后一瓶包含了蓝色的星尘，纯粹的金箔，与粉色的甜酿——",
          "next": [
            202090024
          ]
        },
        "202090024": {
          "id": 202090024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090025
          ]
        },
        "202090025": {
          "id": 202090025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "我替它取了个名字，叫做「翁法罗斯的回忆」。每一次倒在玻璃杯中，都会荡漾起犹如万千星辰的微光，试试它的滋味吧。",
          "next": [
            202090026
          ]
        },
        "202090026": {
          "id": 202090026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "语音消息转换完成",
          "next": [
            202090027
          ]
        },
        "202090027": {
          "id": 202090027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1410,
          "text": "愿我们的记忆，一如杯中的蜜酿。永远、永远闪耀着。永远不会倾尽它的甜美。",
          "next": [
            202090028
          ]
        },
